  "aiContextParagraph": "The movement to appoint Sugiono as the vice president to accompany President Prabowo Subianto has gained momentum with backing from several major political parties. NasDem, Golkar, and PAN have expressed support for his potential selection, describing him as an ideological partner who can immediately begin his duties. While the Gerindra party continues to engage in cross-factional outreach to secure a broader consensus for this candidacy, other groups like the Democratic Party have stated they are still deliberating their position. Internal consultations within the Democratic Party regarding Sugiono and other potential candidates remain ongoing. Simultaneously, there are calls from some parliamentary members for the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) to determine the vice presidential selection through an open voting process to ensure transparency and stability in the executive leadership moving forward.",
